  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Production of fruit concentrates in rural areas in Burundi</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partners intend to start a joint venture, that will set up two mobile fruit processing plants and develop the supply chain and are planning to hire 56 employees and work with 500 outgrowers.The idea for the project originates from the problem of the loss of fruit in northern Burundi, where local partner is farming himself as well. Main reason for this is that farmers cannot transport their products to the markets in urban areas before they perish especially at production peaks.</narrative>
  </description>
